OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with raping woman on  
OL,4,ABrighton beach                         
OL,6,FA 28-year-old man has been charged with
OL,7,Fraping a woman on Brighton beach in    
OL,8,FAugust.                                
OL,10,FSussex Police said a woman, aged in her
OL,11,F20s, had reported the attack near the  
OL,12,Fi360 on the night of 4 August.         
OL,14,FOleksandr Bryndzei, from Stratford, was
OL,15,Farrested the following day on suspicion
OL,16,Fof his involvement, said the force. He 
OL,17,Fwas conditionally bailed while wider   
OL,18,Fenquiries took place.                  
OL,20,FBryndzei was rearrested on Friday and  
OL,21,Fcharged with two counts of rape, it    
OL,22,Fconfirmed.                             
